.TH OPJ_JP3D_TRANSCODE 1 "2026-02-21" "OpenJP3D 0.1.0" "OpenJP3D Manual"
.SH NAME
opj_jp3d_transcode \- transcode a JP3D codestream between EBCOT and HTJ2K
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B opj_jp3d_transcode
.RB [ \-h ]
.RB [ \-\-version ]
.RB [ \-v ]
.RB \-i\ \fIinput.jp3d\fR
.RB \-o\ \fIoutput.jp3d\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B opj_jp3d_transcode
reads a JP3D codestream encoded with the EBCOT block coder and
transcodes it to use the HTJ2K high\-throughput block coder without
performing a full decode/re-encode cycle. The output codestream is
functionally equivalent to the input.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-i\ \fIfile\fR
Input JP3D codestream file (required).
.TP
.BR \-o\ \fIfile\fR
Output JP3D codestream file (required).
.TP
.BR \-v
Verbose output.
.TP
.BR \-h ,\ \-\-help
Print help message and exit.
.TP
.BR \-\-version
Print version information and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
opj_jp3d_transcode \-i ebcot.jp3d \-o htj2k.jp3d
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR opj_jp3d_compress (1),
.BR opj_jp3d_decompress (1),
.BR opj_jp3d_dump (1)
